{"version":1,"content":"<html><body>\n<p>\n前港姐季軍郭柏妍昨日（10月27日）於社交平台分享一段示範唯美拍照技巧短片，短短時間已累積1萬9千觀看次數。一向走清純路線的她今次破格換上一襲銀色低胸鑲鑽晚裝，在充滿水氣玻璃前擺姿勢時卻引發全網哄動。有網民定格畫面後發現其動作幅度過大，導致邊緣位置出現了意想不到失守畫面。\n</p>\n<h2>郭柏妍銀色低胸鑲鑽晚裝展現成熟感</h2>\n<p>短片中郭柏妍親自示範如何利用簡單場景拍出充滿朦朧美感人像，畫面配上「拍照沒招？試試看」字句。她走到一塊布滿水氣玻璃前，面露甜美笑容並伸手抹走表面水珠，隨後便隔着玻璃擺出各種充滿仙氣姿勢。不過該件銀色晚裝剪裁極具挑戰性，當她傾前抹玻璃及不斷轉換姿勢時動作較大，令服裝領口邊緣處於極限狀態。</p>\n<h2>粉絲湧入留言區激讚照片極具質感</h2>\n<p>面對這段引發熱討論短片，雖然郭柏妍尚未就疑似走光一事作出官方回應，但一眾支持者已經迅速在留言區洗版。大批粉絲紛紛湧入社交平台為偶像護航，將焦點放回拍攝效果之上，並留言直指「照片極具質感」。不少支持者更留言誇讚她今次大膽嘗試，指出這身打扮成功讓她擺脫過往既定印象散發出截然不同成熟女人味。</p>\n<h2>前港姐季軍郭柏妍破格挑戰性感底線</h2>\n<p>頂著前港姐季軍頭銜入行以來，郭柏妍一直以清純甜美氣質示人，並憑藉得天獨厚外在條件維持高企人氣。過往她多以乖乖女形象出席各大公開場合，鮮有作如此大膽低胸打扮。這次她突然轉換風格穿上剪裁極其貼身晚裝上陣，強烈視覺反差立刻成為大眾討論焦點，更意外因為服裝移位問題引發大規模網絡熱議。</p>\n<h2>網民直指郭柏妍動作過大疑似露出胸墊</h2>\n<p>短片發布後迅速在各大討論區引起熱烈討論，不少人將焦點放在她伸手抹水珠一幕。有眼利網民反覆觀看該1萬9千點擊率片段後，指出她在傾斜身體時疑似「失守」，並留言表示她「露出了走光邊緣胸墊」。網上輿論呈現兩極化，部分人留言表示拍攝唯美照片時難免會有大動作，另一派則留言指出藝人發布影片前應該仔細檢查畫面。</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179316000364539326_646943536ae17344193c4.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"bkn-20261027170135803-1027_00862_001_02p.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179316000364539326_646943536ae17344193c4.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179316000488047269_20408143486ae17345573af.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"bkn-20261027170135803-1027_00862_001_05p.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179316000488047269_20408143486ae17345573af.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>bkn-20261027170135803-1027_00862_001_05p.jpg/raw</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179316000576182493_20915869176ae173461daa6.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"bkn-20261027170135803-1027_00862_001_06p.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179316000576182493_20915869176ae173461daa6.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179316000675432237_16084109276ae173474f40b.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"rositakpyy_1791028495_3999755920363235059_1457706649.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179316000675432237_16084109276ae173474f40b.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179316001022153132_13133220046ae1734a87d2a.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"rositakpyy_1791028495_3999759318991019024_1457706649.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179316001022153132_13133220046ae1734a87d2a.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：）</figcaption></figure>\n<p>\n</p>\n<p>將來還有什麼演唱會值得留意？<i></i></p>\n<p>有不少歌手宣布舉辦演唱會，小編為你整合了<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/entertainment/hong-kong-concerts-2025-2402813/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">香港演唱會2025一覽</a></b>，包含各演唱會優先購票日期、公開售票日期、門票價錢、座位表等，想搶飛粉絲必定要留意！</p>\n<p>香港有甚麼週末好去處推介？<i></i></p>\n<p>香港18區都非常值得花時間好好探索，一家大細去暢玩的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1217277/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1217277\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">親子好去處</a></b>、拍拖推介32大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1312748/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1312748\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">情侶好去處</a></b>、落雨必去的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1128512/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1128512\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>、慶生推薦20大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1363483/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1363483\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">生日好去處</a></b>、新手必備19大靚景<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1244714/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1244714\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>、秋天戶外<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1257443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1257443\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">露營好去處</a></b>…..</p>\n</body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-28T04:21:19.473430+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":1075,"images":5,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-28T04:00:18+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-28T04:38:37.019763+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-28T04:18:36.392280+00:00","content_hash":"7fd23d46da453f0e17cafae0394bdb9a972e1e2074b7fa48ca156180131d4c94","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}